markdown <<MARKDOWN
## Use an Existing Dataset

1. Open one of the datasets below that matches what you want to classify.
2. Look at the images in the dataset and look for patterns that could help tell the two categories apart.
3. Look at your questions from Step 2 of the Project Planning Guide. Think about how well they work for the images in your dataset. Add or edit questions on the list based on your observations.

[Dataset 1: Basketball vs. Soccer](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1fyODcdV6Tao2w50sgwJGVVqKvfVNgdrX-t6-wQdPAak/edit?usp=sharing)

[Dataset 2: Coffee vs. Tea](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mjBAEAoJnw-SgjR5lCMUjSRGkc-3m36d24fhP3WK3b4/edit?usp=sharing)

[Dataset 3: Dolphin vs. Shark](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1WitTJgmFZliyntsx6aQxNhyMX9cNFYzCqtajOkvdhDs/edit?usp=sharing)

[Dataset 4: Rose vs. Peony](https://docs.google.com/document/d/17Ro3UOuqJVOm128TrrRuw0qbcQDguXVK3KW_trqBuoY/edit?usp=sharing)
MARKDOWN
